Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value List IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.+?)

Start
  ^Codes:
  ^Interface\s+IP\s+Address\s+.*S/L.*Description
  ^-+\s+-+.*$$ -> Interface
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Continue

Interface
  ^\S+\s+ -> Continue.Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+\d+\s+${STATUS}\s+(${DESCRIPTION}|)\s*$$
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${STATUS}\s+(${DESCRIPTION}|)\s*$$
  ^\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Continue

EOF
